  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nRun your own electronic shop! Stock shelves with the latest tech gadgets, set prices to attract customers, handle payments, hire and manage staff, and customize your store layout.Create the ultimate tech shopping experience in your Tech Shop Simulator!<p></p>\n<p>“<b>Tech Shop Simulator</b>” is an engaging first-person simulation where every aspect of running an electronic shop comes to life.</p>\n<p><b>In “Tech Shop Simulator”, every decision matters</b>. Will you rise to the occasion, transforming a modest tech store into a retail powerhouse, while balancing customer satisfaction and finances?</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Design your store</b>, optimizing for both efficiency and aesthetics. Determine the best display for your tech gadgets, manage your aisles, and ensure a seamless shopping experience for your customers.\n</li><li><b>Order stock using an in-game computer</b>. Unpack the latest tech gadgets, organize them in your storage room, and strategically place them on shelves and displays.\n</li><li><b>Handle customer</b> transactions by scanning items and making sure customers leave satisfied with their shopping and checkout experience.\n</li><li><b>Be careful of thieves</b>. Not all clients want you to make money. Some of them just want to pick up and run. In this case, only a magic kick will help!\n</li><li><b>Customers come in many forms</b>. Some clients will be nice to you, some not so nice, but you should be able to capitalize on all situations!\n</li></ul>\n",
